    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3609320/extras/60716325fbd1e9f620963352a59b54ed.avif?t=1750275590\" width=600 height=225 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Take to the skies in this explosive 3D platformer adventure!</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >High above the clouds, <strong>Bombun</strong>\u00a0guards her floating fortress from danger. But peace is short-lived. Her former friend, now reengineered and ruthless, returns as <strong>Robombun</strong>, leading an aerial uprising with a mechanized army of drones.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jump, dodge, and blast your way through soaring sky islands and high-tech strongholds. Master precision platforming, use explosive abilities, and face off in bombastic battles against Robombun\u2019s robotic forces.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you outmaneuver the machines and save the skies?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>3D platforming action.</strong></i></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Traverse through 6 floating worlds.</strong></i></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Stylized visuals and explosive combat mechanics.</strong></i></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3609320/extras/60716325fbd1e9f620963352a59b54ed.avif?t=1750275590\" width=600 height=225 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Take to the skies in this explosive 3D platformer adventure!</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >High above the clouds, <strong>Bombun</strong>\u00a0guards her floating fortress from danger. But peace is short-lived. Her former friend, now reengineered and ruthless, returns as <strong>Robombun</strong>, leading an aerial uprising with a mechanized army of drones.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jump, dodge, and blast your way through soaring sky islands and high-tech strongholds. Master precision platforming, use explosive abilities, and face off in bombastic battles against Robombun\u2019s robotic forces.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you outmaneuver the machines and save the skies?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>3D platforming action.</strong></i></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Traverse through 6 floating worlds.</strong></i></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Stylized visuals and explosive combat mechanics.</strong></i></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
